# SECRETS — OpenPoleMount (template — real values live in gitignored SECRETS.md)

## GitHub — workflow-scoped PAT (classic)

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Account | <github-account> |
| Token | ghp_XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX |
| Scope | repo + workflow |
| Purpose | Pushing .github/workflows/ changes (default deploy PAT lacks `workflow` scope) |
| Recovery | github.com → Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens (classic) |
